Package: anonsurf
Architecture: any
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, iptables, network-manager, procps, tor, systemd | systemctl, sudo
Breaks: anonsurf-gtk (<< 6.0.0~)
Recommends: bleachbit, tor-geoipdb
Suggests: obfs4proxy, snowflake-client
Description: Anonymization toolkit for Parrot Security OS
 AnonSurf is an anonymization toolkit that helps
 prevent tracking and surveillance of the end-user.
 .
 AnonSurf uses iptables to redirect supported TCP traffic and DNS lookups
 through Tor. Local-network exceptions remain and arbitrary UDP is not
 carried by Tor. It disables IPv6 and can optionally close selected
 applications and clear their caches.

